cff-version: 1.2.0
title: docking-made-easy
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hentabli
    given-names: Hamza
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9530-2815
repository-code: https://github.com/hentablihamza/docking-made-easy
url: https://github.com/hentablihamza/docking-made-easy
abstract: >
  A reproducible AutoDock Vina workflow: receptor preparation from a crystal
  structure (ligand, water and buffer removal, missing-atom rebuilding,
  protonation, AutoDock typing), a docking box computed automatically from the
  co-crystal ligand, ligand preparation from SMILES or SDF, single and batch
  docking with configurable exhaustiveness and seed, parsing of Vina output
  into tidy tables and SDF/PDB poses, and a symmetry-corrected redocking check
  against the crystal pose.
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - AutoDock Vina
  - structure-based drug design
  - virtual screening
  - cheminformatics
  - RDKit
